~ start
Az: Hello? Can you hear me?
Fenn: Az? Where are you?
Az laugh: Let's GO!! It works! [i]cough[/i]
Fenn: The bangle?
Az: Yeah! I've got the other one with me. You can talk to someone through them.
Az: Just- [wait=0.3]don't tell [color="B80006"]Post Master Parker[/color]. He'd freak out and call it [wave freq=7 amp=30]sacrilege[/wave] or something.
Fenn starry: You [i]made[/i] these? [font_size=60]That's [shake level=10 rate=30]AWESOME.[/shake][/font_size]
Az: You think? [wait=0.3]Hah, thanks. It's really not much.
Az: Anyways, don't let me stop you. [i]cough[/i].
Fenn worry: You cough a lot. Are you okay?
Az: Uh. Yeah, no, [wait=0.3]I'm fine. Just something caught in my throat.
do EventFlags.set_flag("Az-BangleTalk-CellarGeneral", true)
=> END